WEBVTT

00:06.089 --> 00:07.507
DESTROY

00:08.675 --> 00:10.093
Are you done changing?

00:10.427 --> 00:11.386
Yes.

02:11.131 --> 02:12.257
Tanjiro.

02:13.216 --> 02:16.803
Before you begin with the mission
for Demon Slayer Corps,

02:16.886 --> 02:19.097
I have a few things to clarify.

02:19.848 --> 02:20.765
Yes.

02:21.391 --> 02:25.186
The Demon Slayer Corps' uniform
you are wearing

02:25.353 --> 02:28.106
is made from a special fiber.

02:28.523 --> 02:29.983
Exceptional permeability.

02:30.066 --> 02:31.943
It doesn't get wet or catch fire easily.

02:32.277 --> 02:37.073
Normal demon's claws and teeth
won't be able to rend this uniform.

02:38.408 --> 02:39.659
It's so sturdy.

02:40.285 --> 02:44.289
Also, the Nichirin blade you own

02:44.455 --> 02:46.791
will change its color
depending on the owner.

02:46.875 --> 02:49.377
Every color has its own characteristics.

02:50.420 --> 02:56.301
However, black swords are too rare.
I don't understand its specialty.

02:57.552 --> 02:59.554
Because I really don't understand...

02:59.804 --> 03:03.099
If that's the case,
is there a problem, Master Urokodaki?

03:04.017 --> 03:05.810
I really don't understand.

03:05.977 --> 03:09.981
I heard only talented swordsmen
who aren't appreciated use black swords.

03:11.566 --> 03:14.736
I don't know what I can achieve
in Demon Slayer Corps,

03:16.112 --> 03:19.282
but I'll turn Nezuko back into a human.

03:20.325 --> 03:22.285
You're right.

03:22.785 --> 03:25.163
I believe you can achieve it.

03:25.663 --> 03:26.706
Yes.

03:27.373 --> 03:29.751
Other than that, this thing.

03:30.919 --> 03:34.297
It's a box for you
to carry your sister during the day.

03:34.714 --> 03:38.426
It was made of Mist Cloud Fir,
a very light wood.

03:39.093 --> 03:42.388
The exterior is hard
because of the rock lacquer coating.

03:42.472 --> 03:44.182
It's strong and durable.

03:45.099 --> 03:46.476
Thank you very much.

03:48.144 --> 03:49.229
It's so light!

03:49.312 --> 03:51.147
This is really light, Master Urokodaki!

03:58.029 --> 03:59.072
Nezuko.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.698
Get inside.

04:01.491 --> 04:02.575
Can you do that?

04:18.925 --> 04:19.926
Nezuko.

04:20.385 --> 04:22.595
From now on, we'll always be together.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.601
We'll get going then.

04:30.853 --> 04:32.230
Hang on.

05:02.969 --> 05:05.471
Nezuko, are you okay?

05:11.811 --> 05:12.895
Nezuko?

05:14.314 --> 05:16.399
This is just my guess.

05:16.482 --> 05:19.694
Nezuko uses sleep to compensate
for not consuming human flesh.

05:19.944 --> 05:24.240
Maybe she's using this method
to regain energy.

05:31.080 --> 05:34.292
Nezuko, rest well.

05:52.060 --> 05:55.063
The northwestern town is here, right?

06:20.379 --> 06:22.548
Look at Mr. Kazumi.

06:23.257 --> 06:25.426
How pitiful. He looks emaciated.

06:31.682 --> 06:34.519
That's because Satoko was abducted
when they were together.

06:43.027 --> 06:45.446
I feel uneasy every night.

06:46.072 --> 06:47.865
How annoying.

06:48.407 --> 06:51.160
A young girl will be abducted
during nighttime.

06:55.832 --> 06:56.999
Mr. Kazumi!

07:04.132 --> 07:07.301
I have something to ask you. May I?

07:13.224 --> 07:15.518
Satoko vanished here.

07:16.769 --> 07:19.147
I don't know if you'll believe me.

07:20.648 --> 07:21.691
I do.

07:22.525 --> 07:23.693
I believe you.

07:25.736 --> 07:26.779
I believe you!

07:37.123 --> 07:39.584
Although the smell of a demon remains,

07:41.085 --> 07:42.545
it's vague.

07:46.340 --> 07:47.717
Something feels wrong.

07:49.844 --> 07:51.929
Who is this kid?

08:00.771 --> 08:02.148
What the hell did you say?

08:04.192 --> 08:05.610
She vanished?

08:06.110 --> 08:07.403
Damn you!

08:07.487 --> 08:10.239
Dear, please stop!

09:00.122 --> 09:01.707
Please believe me.

09:03.918 --> 09:05.711
Satoko vanished into thin air.

09:06.671 --> 09:07.797
I believe you.

09:08.673 --> 09:11.175
I came here because of that.

09:17.723 --> 09:19.433
You're going to keep doing this?

09:20.017 --> 09:20.935
Yes.

09:21.644 --> 09:23.354
But it's really late.

09:23.896 --> 09:26.899
I'm very happy
that you're concerned about me.

09:27.233 --> 09:28.693
You can continue tomorrow.

09:28.776 --> 09:30.570
You should rest first.

09:32.989 --> 09:34.949
Those guys only come out at night.

09:35.741 --> 09:38.119
So, I can't rest now.

09:39.328 --> 09:42.081
I discovered a new smell around here.

09:43.040 --> 09:45.334
Those guys must be nearby.

09:46.294 --> 09:47.545
Those guys?

09:48.504 --> 09:51.382
Could you be...

09:59.348 --> 10:00.850
That's so terrifying.

10:01.601 --> 10:04.562
Don't go out unless it's necessary.

10:05.146 --> 10:06.606
Yes, Mom.

10:06.939 --> 10:08.774
Good night then.

11:21.180 --> 11:24.225
I wonder how the girls
who were abducted are doing.

11:25.559 --> 11:27.311
I really hope they are doing fine.

12:06.934 --> 12:08.436
What's up with you?

12:09.895 --> 12:10.980
He runs so fast.

12:11.772 --> 12:13.357
The smell is getting stronger.

12:13.858 --> 12:15.192
The demon has appeared.

12:20.072 --> 12:21.323
He jumped onto the roof.

12:21.699 --> 12:22.950
Demon?

12:23.617 --> 12:24.785
Demon Slayer Corps?

12:25.411 --> 12:26.495
They are real.

12:37.339 --> 12:38.382
Right here.

12:39.258 --> 12:40.676
The demon is right here.

12:46.056 --> 12:47.224
There are two smells.

12:48.058 --> 12:50.227
A demon and a girl.

12:52.980 --> 12:54.398
I don't see them anywhere.

12:59.570 --> 13:00.654
But...

13:05.951 --> 13:08.037
The place with the strongest smell

13:09.079 --> 13:10.122
is here!

13:35.272 --> 13:36.607
He's a caster demon.

13:37.566 --> 13:41.195
There are demons who can use a type
of special spells, Blood Demon Arts.

13:41.278 --> 13:42.780
Those are the so-called caster demons.

13:43.239 --> 13:46.992
You will probably fight
against those demons later.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.999
Where are the girls you abducted?

13:58.337 --> 14:00.089
Besides, I have two questions for you.

14:10.724 --> 14:11.976
That guy is...

14:12.393 --> 14:13.477
Mr. Kazumi.

14:13.644 --> 14:16.230
Please carry her and stand beside me.

14:16.814 --> 14:19.191
As long as you stand on this side,
I can protect you.

14:23.237 --> 14:26.615
The demon will either appear
from the ground or the wall.

14:28.742 --> 14:32.037
Or maybe it will appear out of the blue.

14:36.417 --> 14:40.963
But when the demon goes into hiding,
his smell doesn't vanish.

14:45.718 --> 14:46.635
He's coming.

14:47.344 --> 14:48.470
Breath of Water.

14:48.721 --> 14:49.847
Fifth Form!

14:54.143 --> 14:55.227
Three demons!

14:58.981 --> 15:00.232
Calm down.

15:00.649 --> 15:01.817
I can do this.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.069
Eighth Form.

15:06.155 --> 15:07.406
Waterfall Basin!

15:13.662 --> 15:16.498
Tanjiro, listen carefully.

15:17.875 --> 15:21.795
There's only one demon in this world

15:21.921 --> 15:26.383
who can use his blood
to change humans into demons.

15:27.217 --> 15:28.510
There's only one.

15:29.011 --> 15:31.430
Thousands of years ago,

15:31.513 --> 15:33.974
he was the first person
to turn into a demon.

15:34.391 --> 15:37.770
In other words,
he's the enemy of your family.

15:37.895 --> 15:44.652
I think he should know the way
to turn your sister back into a human.

15:46.987 --> 15:49.156
That demon's name is...

15:54.745 --> 15:56.747
Muzan Kibutsuji.

15:57.623 --> 15:59.875
Eighth Form, Waterfall Basin.

16:02.711 --> 16:03.754
It's not deep enough.

16:04.338 --> 16:06.548
I didn't hit their fatal weakness

16:07.257 --> 16:09.510
because I changed the form midway.

16:18.769 --> 16:21.021
These three demons have the same smell.

16:21.939 --> 16:24.692
I heard demons
don't work in groups generally.

16:26.694 --> 16:29.154
So the demon must have
divided himself into three.

16:30.322 --> 16:33.367
I need to protect these two people
and kill the three demons.

16:33.826 --> 16:35.202
I must not back down.

16:35.411 --> 16:39.248
I must ask him about Muzan Kibutsuji

16:39.832 --> 16:42.960
and the way to turn
a demon back into a human.

16:44.878 --> 16:46.171
Total Concentration Breathing.

16:47.423 --> 16:48.757
Breath of Water.

16:49.299 --> 16:52.845
Second Form, Water Wheel.

16:56.140 --> 16:57.558
I didn't strike deep enough again.

17:06.608 --> 17:07.985
I can't continue to pursue him.

17:08.652 --> 17:12.197
If I want to protect them,
I can't strike with all I got.

17:12.406 --> 17:14.241
Damn you!

17:15.117 --> 17:16.785
Don't get in the way!

17:16.869 --> 17:19.872
If this drags on, the woman's flesh
won't be fresh enough!

17:20.706 --> 17:23.834
The girl is already 16 years old.

17:23.917 --> 17:27.713
If I don't eat her, the taste of her flesh
will get worse every minute!

17:33.802 --> 17:36.263
Hey, you. Calm down.

17:36.847 --> 17:38.265
It's okay.

17:38.682 --> 17:40.726
Even if we can't eat her tonight,

17:41.101 --> 17:44.897
we've already eaten a lot of
16-year-old girls in this town.

17:45.439 --> 17:48.233
Every one of them was delicious.

17:48.901 --> 17:50.652
I'm already satisfied.

17:50.736 --> 17:52.780
But I'm not!

17:52.863 --> 17:56.450
I still want to eat more!

17:57.367 --> 17:58.577
Monsters.

17:59.161 --> 18:01.872
Return Satoko who you abducted
the day before yesterday to me.

18:11.632 --> 18:13.133
Satoko?

18:14.760 --> 18:16.762
Who do you mean?

18:20.140 --> 18:24.478
If her hairpin is among these trophies,

18:24.645 --> 18:26.188
then we've eaten her.

19:10.274 --> 19:11.692
I missed the fatal strike again.

19:11.775 --> 19:13.485
He escaped so quickly into the ground.

19:14.778 --> 19:17.197
Damn it. I got too close to the wall.

19:32.963 --> 19:36.592
You're clearly a human.
Why are you carrying a demon?

19:41.221 --> 19:42.389
What's going on?

19:42.472 --> 19:44.391
What's their relationship?

19:44.933 --> 19:48.604
Can a swordsman team up with a demon?

19:55.569 --> 19:57.696
I have no idea what's going on.

20:43.700 --> 20:44.743
Nezuko.

20:50.165 --> 20:53.085
Maybe this is just self-consoling.

20:53.377 --> 20:55.921
When Nezuko was deep in sleep,

20:56.088 --> 20:58.048
I hinted at her.

20:58.632 --> 20:59.716
Hint?

21:00.259 --> 21:03.011
"Humans are your family.

21:03.762 --> 21:05.347
You must protect humans.

21:06.139 --> 21:08.100
Demons are your nemeses."

21:15.148 --> 21:16.233
Nezuko!

21:16.441 --> 21:20.362
A demon who never forgives others
for hurting humans.

22:52.954 --> 22:54.998
Thank goodness, Nezuko kicked him.

22:55.082 --> 22:56.083
Thank you.

22:57.334 --> 22:59.669
It didn't break even though you kicked
from the inside.

22:59.836 --> 23:02.047
This box is really durable.

23:03.924 --> 23:06.259
But isn't it cramped to stay in the box?

23:06.343 --> 23:07.469
Is it uncomfortable?

23:07.636 --> 23:11.681
I'll find a time and make
a bigger box for you, Nezuko.

23:14.059 --> 23:16.770
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:16.937 --> 23:19.981
The demon who appeared this time
with the loud teeth-grinding sound...

23:20.065 --> 23:23.110
I heard it was a habit he got
from the time he was still a human.

23:23.568 --> 23:26.363
Next, episode 7, "Muzan Kibutsuji."

23:26.780 --> 23:27.948
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.031 --> 23:29.407
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
